        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Mul-T-Lock High Security Lock Commercial Door Lever Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMul-T-Lock's Grade 1 commercial door locks are designed to provide superior door protection with uncompromised key control. The Key Card owner is the only person allowed to have the keys duplicated. Remove the worry about anyone making duplicates of your keys, picking or bumping your door locks. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nComplies with ANSI/BHMA A156.2-1996, Series 4000, Grade 1. Listed by UL / ULC for ratings of \u001cA\u001d  label (3 hours), UL10C / UBC 7-2 (1997) positive pressure, for single doors up to 4\u0019'0\"\u001d x 8'\u00190\"\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWindstorm Resistant Product Listing - ANSI A250.13-2003, ASTM E1886-02, ASTM E330-02. Outswing: 350 ft-lbs., Inswing: N/R, Design Load Rating: 1485 lbf.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAssembled in the USA meeting the requirements of the <b>Buy American Act</b>. Meets all applicable accessibility requirements of the ADA. These levers are heavy duty solid cast, with no plastic inserts, and fully adjustable for 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\" doors. Supplied standard with 1 owner key card per key combination and 2 keys per lock cylinder. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Mul-T-Lock 206SKIKSH-PDQGTPHL Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>MUL-T-LOCK's Patented Interactive Key Control System</li>\r\n<li>Bump Proof Lock Design</li>\r\n<li>Mul-T-Lock 206S Security Keyway</li>\r\n<li>UL437 Drill and Pick Resistance Cylinder</li>\r\n<li><b>ADA (America Disabilities Act) Compliant</b></li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable for 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\" thick doors.</li>\r\n<li>Door Prep: Fits standard 161 door prep.</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Case: Heavy duty zinc die-cast, investment cast and chromated cold rolled steel mechanism. Billet steel spindles.</li>\r\n<li>Front: 2-1/4\" X 1-1/8\" Beveled 1/8\" on 2\".</li>\r\n<li>Strike: 4-7/8\" X 1-1/4\" (Standard ASA). Stainless steel, or wrought bronze.</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Latchbolt: 9/16\" throw. Adjustable front for flat or beveled doors.</li>\r\n<li>Handing: Non-handed.</li>\r\n<li>Trim: Philadelphia levers solid zinc diecast.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Mul-T-Lock Grade 1 High Security Lock Commercial Door Lever",
                "description": "Mul-T-Lock Grade 1 Commercial Door Lever.  High security restricted keyway  Grade 1 commercial door levers. These standard style commercial levers are ADA compliant and available in keyed entry, classroom, storeroom, Office Entry, Classroom Security or Store Door functions.  Your choice of Satin Chrome, Oil Rubbed Bronze or Polished Brass.\r\n",
                "keywords": "MTL-206SKIKSH-PDQGTPHL Grade 1 High Security Door Levers, MTL- LCK-AL54 Grade 1 Security Door Levers, Mul-T-Lock Grade 1 door Levers, Mul-T-Lock commercial Levers, ADA compliant commercial door Levers, Mul-T-Lock commercial door locks, Grade 1 Mul-T-Lock Security Door Lever Locksets, Mul-T-Lock levers, Mul-T-Lock door levers, commercial doorlevers, commercial grade levers, commercial door lever locks, Mul-T-Lock commercial door locks,"
